IMPORTANT

All changes and/or additions to GitHub Workflows MUST be approved by the
Mozilla GitHub Enterprise Administrators Team.

See https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/l/cp/f5ypVsa7 for contact information, or
reach out on Matrix: https://chat.mozilla.org/#/room/#github-admin:mozilla.org

The `sync-official-release.yml` workflow is specific to this Fenix fork. It checks the official
Firefox Android release tags, prepares a candidate only when a newer stable tag exists, and merges a
validated synchronization pull request into `fenix`. It does not build or publish APKs.
